  "fluff": {
    "overview": "<p>Com Guard conventional infantry benefit from ComStar's access to preserved Star League technology, fielding weapons and equipment that match or exceed the standard issue of any Inner Sphere military, backed by the institutional discipline of the secular Order's professional military culture. Towing light autocannon optimized for long-range harassment fire, these field gun crews provide economical suppressive capability at extended distances where heavier weapons would be wasted on area targets.</p>"
